{
  "id": 10155006034104,
  "title": "Sense Ortho Ultra Mattress - Ivory White",
  "handle": "sense-ortho-ultra-mattress",
  "description": "<p>Sleepyhead Sense Ortho Ultra – Cool. Smart. Seriously Supportive.\n<br>When sleep’s your superpower, you need a mattress that doesn’t just keep up—it levels up. The new Sense Ortho Ultra is a total upgrade in comfort tech and cooling design. With a thicker layer of BodyIQ memory foam that intuitively adapts to every body curve (and yes, zero motion transfer), this mattress makes every sleep feel customized.</p>\n\n<p>Wrapped in cool-to-the-touch, high GSM knitted fabric, it doesn’t just look luxe—it feels cooler. Perfect for hot sleepers or those who want their bed to double as a chill zone. Beneath the memory foam, a smart profile foam layer with egg tray structure keeps airflow flowing and pressure points zeroed out. It’s also a built-in shock absorber for your spine.</p>\n\n<p>And here’s the part your back will thank you for: the firm base layer offers deep orthopedic support and better posture alignment through the night. Toss in a zipper cover that’s removable and washable? It’s sleep hygiene made stylish.</p>\n\n<p>Oh—and did we mention the 100-Night Trial and 12-Year Warranty?\n<br>This mattress doesn’t just promise sleep. It delivers it, smarter.</p>",
